                <pb facs="0813" n="725" xml:id="pg725"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. McCormick.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-02-19"><hi rendition="#italic">February 19,
                        1904</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay informs Mr. McCormick that the United States Government considers the
                    reply of the Russian Government as responsive to the proposal of this Government
                    and will at once communicate it to the Governments of China and Japan, which
                    have already signified their adherence to the principles of the proposal.)</p>
            </div>
